flag(60,'distractors','General-purpose robots being unable to retain state and current observations becoming unnecessary are implausible. Compare actual architecture features and their sufficiency/necessity without absolute exclusions.')
flag(62,'distractors','Maximum intensity for every response, irrelevant words/context and contradictory gestures having no effect are weak. Use parallel plausible multimodal output plans for an explicit conversational goal rather than three categorical overclaims.')
